{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"﻿﻿\n　　　　　こんばんは　小林由依です　　　　　　　　　　　　渡邉理佐卒業コンサートにお越しくださった皆様　配信をご覧くださった皆様　ありがとうございました🤍　　　　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2DSMC64CQZ6FJ157DA3DR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2DTNC7V4EVPP36FNETT8H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2DVJ4AKF72BPTJT4V5WFW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2DWJGNQMV3VRYZKJBWGCT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　　　　　　最近は特に、自然と一期生で集まっていることが多くて、写真もたくさん撮りました　　集まるたび、少なっ！笑 って笑ってるけどもう少しこのままが続いてほしいな〜なんて。　　　　　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2DXGCCQJJE36808DH8SPH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2DYGNJNK32SGX8NR01W1Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2DZE91GX31MP842W5CF8S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2E0DB3F36V4XW7PD19Z7Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　　　　　　　　2日間楽しい時間をありがとう　　　　　理佐卒業おめでとう🕊　　　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2E1CE7JXVZS0BXDW83MKF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2E2EWC64TZA3JQKKME7SC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　　　　　　　see you again ⊿⊿　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　"}],"source":"archive"}